surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Use of markers for characterizing and exploiting non additive QTL variation in breeding programmes</article-title><source>Proceedings of the 8th World Congress on Genetics Applied to Livestock Production: CD-ROM; communication 30-11</source><year>2006</year></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>